<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53894" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταδέω</span></b>  (B), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lack, need</i>, c. gen., esp. of numbers, ἡ [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁδὸς</span>]
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταδέει πεντεκαίδεκα σταδίων</span>
				[<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς</span>] 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μὴ εἶναι πεντακοσίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.7
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυραμίδα . . εἴκοσι ποδῶν καταδέουσαν
					τριῶν πλέθρων</span>”
				<i>wanting</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					20
				</span></i>
			 feet of <i><span class="en">
				3
			</span></i> plethra, ib.<i><span class="en">
				134
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕνδεκα μυριάδες ἦσαν, μιῆς Χιλιάδος
					. . καταδέουσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					9.30
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				70
			</span></i>; [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ναυτικὸν</span>] <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δύο νεῶν κατέδεε ἐς τὸν ἀριθμόν</span>
			<i>there was a lack</i> of two ships, <i><span class="en">
				8.82
			</span></i> (unless <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατέδεε</span> be
			impersonal). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>come after, be behind</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Θῆβαι ἀνδρὸς ἰδιώτου καταδέουσιν εἰς
					εὐδαιμονίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Paus.
					8.33.2
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
